= Chen Gongbo

One of the founding members of the Communist Party, Chen Gongbo has since turned away from Marxism and towards the KMT. He now serves as one of the party's preeminent left-wing theorists in areas of labour organisation, attempting to avoid completely dismantling the popular movement without succumbing to unbridled mass violence.

